{
  "name": "Empower Sneak Attack (Spelljacker)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Immediately after a creature you can see within 30 feet of you casts a level 1+ spell, you can take a Reaction to absorb magical energy from the spell. When you do so, until the end of your next turn, the next time you hit with your Sneak Attack you deal extra Force damage. To determine the extra damage, roll a number of d6s equal to the spell's level, and add them together.</p><p>You can take this Reaction a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
